From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:47:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: carry the Iris VP9 experiment

Add the SM8250 VP9 firmware-interface fixes and decoder display-delay controls.
Keep the current Venus configuration until Iris has fresh runtime validation.
Advance to release 104 without enabling Iris or changing driver selection.
