+From b040d1c802189f06e226df8b6b0d73e7e7eed24e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
+Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:46:46 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 174/176] media: iris: fix SM8250 VP9 firmware session and
+ buffer handling
+
+Declare non-secure VP9 sessions before registering buffers, provide the stock
+firmware with output extradata storage, and initialize the compressed input packet.
+
+These changes returned reference-exact VP9 frames on the OnePlus 8 Pro r88 test
+kernel. Buffer counts are unchanged. Screen-off corruption remains unresolved.
