+From 87d29cd05c675bd92c2635c3cead4c063408f3dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
+Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:58:06 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 175/176] media: iris: support decode-order output on HFI gen2
+
+Expose the standard display-delay controls for synchronous per-picture clients.
+
+Backport of Xilin Wu's upstream submission, with surrounding context adapted to
+the Nura kernel. The 49 added lines are unchanged.
+
+Link: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-media/20261029-iris-va-fixes-v1-1-44a2783f782b@radxa.com/
+Signed-off-by: Xilin Wu <sophon@radxa.com>
+---
+ drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c |  8 ++++++++
+ .../media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen2.c  | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
